WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.720
The garden path is broken.
Can you repair it?

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.740
Hello, I'm Arthur, the landscaper.

3
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.580
I'll take out the old stones,
and I'll lay new ones.

4
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.440
Will the garden be ready this week?

5
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:23.480
Yes. First I prepare the ground. Then I
lay the stones, and I plant some lavender.

6
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.300
It will look neat again.
